WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.160
A family tree, in two rows.

2
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:06.630
As the top row fades,
the bottom row lights up,

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.370
and the same names come round again.

4
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.620
Moonlight.

5
00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.870
A farmhouse window, its lattice open.

6
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.270
Inside, two young people bend over a book.

7
00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.480
"Con-trary!"

8
00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:22.020
says a voice "as sweet as a silver bell".

9
00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:26.200
Outside, in the dark
garden, someone is watching.

10
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.920
A novel of storms and ghosts, and
it ends with a reading lesson.

11
00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.730
Is that a happy ending?

12
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.170
In this mission, you'll
untangle a second generation,

13
00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.700
born into names that come round again.

14
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:43.040
You'll see Heathcliff try to make
one boy "grow as crooked as another".

15
00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:46.180
And you'll ask what that
reading lesson changes.

16
00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:49.790
Your mission: decide whether
it is a happy ending.
